# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Ships in out/ from public/. Evaluated before static assets.
# Legacy WordPress URLs get appended here (Bulk list) once discovery (Wayback CDX + GSC
# 404 report) produces the old→new map — never blanket-to-home.

# www → apex. Requires www.skyshade.co.il to be attached to the Pages project as a custom
# domain (Workers & Pages → skyshade → Custom domains); until then Cloudflare DNS/rules
# must do it.
https://www.skyshade.co.il/* https://skyshade.co.il/:splat 301

# Pre-media-pipeline project photos that external pages may still hot-link → the CDN.
/project-* https://imgquarry.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1600,quality=85,format=auto/skyshade/gallery/project-:splat 301
